meta {
  name: Broker reference
  seq: 12
}

docs {
  **Docs mirror:** repo `docs/broker-guide.md` (credentials, token refresh, symbols, IP whitelist).

  ## raw_creds (colon-delimited)
  | broker_type | format |
  |-------------|--------|
  | zerodha | api_key:access_token |
  | mt5_cloud | auth_token:account_id |
  | angel | api_key:client_code:jwt |
  | dhan | client_id:access_token |

  Indian: `exchange` NSE|BSE required; `product` default MIS.

  ## Token refresh (manual v1)
  | Broker | TTL | PUT when expired |
  |--------|-----|------------------|
  | Zerodha | ~1 day | api_key:access_token |
  | Angel | hours | api_key:client_code:jwt |
  | Dhan | ~24h | client_id:access_token |
  | MT5 | long-lived | auth_token:account_id |

  ## Symbol pairing
  - mt5_cloud → EURUSD, GBPUSD (lots e.g. 0.01)
  - zerodha/angel/dhan → RELIANCE, TCS (integer shares)
  - EURUSD on Indian cred → trade rejected invalid_symbol

  ## Create templates
  create-zerodha | create-mt5 | create-angel | create-dhan → verify → Webhooks
}
